  <item>
    <title>01.节前最后一天我们开张了！第一杯，敬春节！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65c32c6635dd8780ed9c6fd9</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65c32c6635dd8780ed9c6fd9</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 07 Feb 2024 11:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>🈺️</span><strong><span>「柒六酒吧」正式营业，喜欢您来！</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>跟70后传统媒体人「太后」、90后传媒菜鸟「小小陈」一起来唠唠春节闲嗑儿！</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>📔Show Notes:</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 76年和98年的两位播客新人给您问好！（应该都能看出来「柒六酒吧」是个谐音梗吧 ）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="181">03:01</a> 电视人唠电视：你还看春晚吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="274">04:34</a>曾经的春晚“造梗”，如今的春晚“追梗”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="476">07:56</a>70后的春晚记忆：费翔！费翔！还是费翔！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="549">09:09</a>未解之谜：98年的小小陈为什么对99年的春晚金曲耳熟能详</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="714">11:54</a>春晚！你别总硬挠痒痒让我笑，再给我一大嘴巴子让我哭</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="864">14:24</a> 赵本山最后一次登台那年，也是有外公在的最后一次年夜饭</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="972">16:12</a> 70后太后儿时的春节是一帧帧宝贵的胶片家庭合影</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1078">17:58</a> 对以后的孩子们来说，烟花可能就只是烟花了，并不代表着春节</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1240">20:40</a> 70后、90后儿时的共同回忆：过年添新衣！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1516">25:16</a> &nbsp;消失的“囤年货”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1578">26:18</a>四川腊肉香肠、东北的酸菜馅饺子、上海的肉汤圆……那些天南海北的春节必备</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1774">29:34</a>一位90后女生的年夜饭感受：四个冷冷清清的人坐在冷冷清清的家里吃着冷冷清清的年夜饭</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1872">31:12</a> 太后回忆儿时“流水席”式年夜饭</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2018">33:38</a> 压垮90后打工狗的压岁钱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2092">34:52</a> 还是90后：过年也没啥大烦恼，大不了不听！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2184">36:24</a> 70后锐评90后的婚恋压力：也许我们的时间点差不多，但是你别教我做事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2489">41:29</a> 70后的过年感受：我的爸爸已经不知道什么是新年了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2580">43:00</a> 拧巴的90后女生也想要趁着春节拉拧巴的父母一把</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2712">45:12</a> 给大家一些过年新灵感吧！</span></p><span></span><p><span>👧</span><strong><span>本期主播</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>太后、小小陈</span></p><span></span><p><span>祝大家春节愉快，福气满满！</span></p>]]></description>
